# source (under tools/live/odm-services)  dest (under the vendor image's odm/)  mode  SELinux type
# Files from the stock H.40 euclid odm (StockRom/H40-images/system.img -> system/euclid/odm.img; bin/hw services and
# SHA256SUMS in this directory covers every source; build-port-b.sh checks it, preflight-b.sh re-checks the installed copies.
