# AIDL ICharger for ColorOS 17 (it only looks up vendor.oplus.hardware.charger.ICharger/default): Java stub from tools/live/charger-aidl
# (sibling session's work, copied unchanged), run by app_process from port-charger-aidl.rc. The vintf fragment declares HIDL 1.0 + AIDL V12.
port/etc/vintf/manifest/manifest_oplus_charger.xml  etc/vintf/manifest/manifest_oplus_charger.xml  0644 vendor_configs_file
port/etc/init/port-charger-aidl.rc  etc/init/port-charger-aidl.rc  0644 vendor_configs_file
port/lib64/port-charger.dex  lib64/port-charger.dex  0644 vendor_file
# eSE HAL (build 17d; needs /dev/p73 from the CONFIG_NFC_P73_ESE kernel + the corrected eSE power GPIO, handoff §12/12b, tools/live/ese-kernel).
# The HAL exits once (oneshot) on a kernel without /dev/p73.
